# Exclude build artifacts
**/build
**/build/**
**/out
**/out/**
**/*.exe
**/*.exe~
**/*.apk
**/*.aar
**/*.class
**/*.log
**/*.tmp

# Hide IDE and OS files
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Skip Android Studio/Gradle wrapper caches
**/.gradle
**/.gradle/**
**/gradle/wrapper/dists
**/gradle/wrapper/dists/**
**/android-client/app/build
**/android-client/build

# Go build cache and artifacts
*.test
**/*.test

# Local environment settings
local.properties
